{"absolute_url":"https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/globalizationpartners/jobs/7826138003","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":5804980003,"location":{"name":"United States (Remote-First)"},"metadata":[{"id":11363870003,"name":"Region","value":"NA","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":14210643003,"name":"FADV_Package","value":"2114_GLOBAL PACKAGE","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":14210628003,"name":"FADV_Account","value":"234586_GLOBALIZATION PARTNERS LLC","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":6124467003,"name":"Remote","value":null,"value_type":"yes_no"}],"id":7826138003,"updated_at":"2026-08-11T05:42:16-04:00","requisition_id":"15374","title":"Principal Program Manager ","pay_input_ranges":[],"company_name":"G-P","first_published":"2026-08-06T11:51:22-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"\u0026lt;div class=\u0026quot;content-intro\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;About Us\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Our leading SaaS-based Global Employment Platform™ enables clients to expand into over 180 countries quickly and efficiently, without the complexities of establishing local entities. At G-P, we’re dedicated to breaking down barriers to global business and creating opportunities for everyone, everywhere.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Our diverse, remote-first teams are essential to our success. We empower our Dream Team members with flexibility and resources, fostering an environment where innovation thrives and every contribution is valued and celebrated.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;The work you do here will positively impact lives around the world. We stand by our promise: Opportunity Made Possible. In addition to competitive compensation and benefits, we invite you to join us in expanding your skills and helping to reshape the future of work.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;At G-P, we assist organizations in building exceptional global teams in days, not months—streamlining the hiring, onboarding, and management process to unlock growth potential for all.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/div\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;About the Position\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;The Enterprise Program Management Office (EPMO) leads G-P\u0026#39;s highest-priority, strategic, cross-functional initiatives – the complex, high-visibility programs that don\u0026#39;t sit neatly inside any one function. We\u0026#39;re intentionally a small, senior team that focuses our resources on programs that are large in scope, span multiple departments, and directly advance G-P\u0026#39;s most important corporate goals.\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;As a Principal Program Manager, you will lead large, ambiguous, cross-functional programs, from executive-level framing down to daily execution, with minimal oversight. You will identify and overcome delivery roadblocks in a complex, cross-functional environment while ensuring alignment with corporate goals, executive timelines, and top-tier quality standards. You will partner directly with functional leaders and executives across the company, act as a force multiplier for cross-functional teams, and bring focus and momentum to G-P\u0026#39;s most complex initiatives. Although this is a senior individual-contributor role, the ability to lead through influence is paramount to your success.\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;What You’ll Do\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Independently lead the end-to-end lifecycle of large, complex, cross-functional programs from scoping and business case through execution, launch, and post-launch measurement.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Act as a trusted business partner to functional executives and their leadership teams, serving as their go-to contact for EPMO-supported work and as an escalation point when a program needs senior-level intervention.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Stand up and lead cross-functional working teams without formal authority over their members: establishing shared goals, a regular cadence, and clear accountability across departments.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Drive momentum as a force multiplier: set goals for today, this week, and the month ahead; unblock dependencies; keep distributed stakeholders aligned to a single source of truth.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Define macro program scope, objectives, and success criteria; develop comprehensive project plans and provide the authoritative record of program decisions and status.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Communicate program health (scope, schedule, risk, resourcing) clearly and regularly to senior and executive leadership, tailoring the message to the audience.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Facilitate cross-functional workshops to force difficult decisions, then hold the team accountable to the resulting actions.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Contribute to the EPMO team\u0026#39;s standards, tools, and best practices for program management, including the adoption of AI capabilities throughout the program lifecycle.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Set the bar for program management excellence company-wide and mentor other program managers, even without formal direct reports.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;What We\u0026#39;re Looking For:\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;em\u0026gt;Minimum Requirements\u0026lt;/em\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;10+ years leading enterprise-level, cross-functional programs, with a track record of independently driving large, ambiguous initiatives to successful outcomes within a fast-paced environment.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Proven ability to lead through influence, not authority – building trust and accountability with senior stakeholders, cross-functional teams, and globally diverse team members you don\u0026#39;t formally manage.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Mastery in executive communication, possessing the ability to communicate at all levels of the organization with extreme clarity, precision, and diplomatic grace.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;A strong bias toward ownership and independent execution; you thrive with real autonomy and ambiguity rather than needing a defined playbook.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Sound business judgment and the ability to quickly get fluent enough in a new functional domain (e.g., Legal, Finance, Revenue) to lead programs within it credibly.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Comfortable in a lean, high-performing team where you do the work directly rather than delegate it.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Proven ability to steer multiple high-priority initiatives simultaneously, seamlessly managing shifting corporate dependencies and deadlines.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Familiarity with AI systems to enhance personal and team productivity.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Experience with standard project/program/portfolio tooling and using AI capabilities to enhance and scale project/program management.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Bachelor’s degree in Business Administration, Management, or a related field (or equivalent practical experience).\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;em\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;Preferred Qualifications\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/em\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Proficiency in the rapidly evolving AI landscape (LLMs, generative AI, agentic frameworks) with a demonstrated ability to integrate these capabilities into practical, future-proof program management strategies.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Experience managing projects / programs with significant AI scope.\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Professional certifications such as PMP or PgMP.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;The annual gross base salary range for this position is $144,000 - $215,000 \u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;plus variable compensation.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;div class=\u0026quot;content-conclusion\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;div id=\u0026quot;message-list_1761669766.039629\u0026quot; class=\u0026quot;c-virtual_list__item\u0026quot; data-qa=\u0026quot;virtual-list-item\u0026quot; data-item-key=\u0026quot;1761669766.039629\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;div class=\u0026quot;c-message_kit__background c-message_kit__background--hovered p-message_pane_message__message c-message_kit__message\u0026quot; data-qa=\u0026quot;message_container\u0026quot; data-qa-unprocessed=\u0026quot;false\u0026quot; data-qa-placeholder=\u0026quot;false\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;div class=\u0026quot;c-message_kit__hover c-message_kit__hover--hovered\u0026quot; data-qa-hover=\u0026quot;true\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;div class=\u0026quot;c-message_kit__actions c-message_kit__actions--default\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;div class=\u0026quot;c-message_kit__gutter\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;div class=\u0026quot;c-message_kit__gutter__right\u0026quot; data-qa=\u0026quot;message_content\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;div class=\u0026quot;c-message_kit__blocks c-message_kit__blocks--rich_text\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;div class=\u0026quot;c-message__message_blocks c-message__message_blocks--rich_text\u0026quot; data-qa=\u0026quot;message-text\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;div class=\u0026quot;p-block_kit_renderer\u0026quot; data-qa=\u0026quot;block-kit-renderer\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;div class=\u0026quot;p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper--first\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;div class=\u0026quot;p-rich_text_block\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Our ranges are established using objective market benchmarking data for this level of work. Final placement within the range is determined by gender-neutral criteria, including the candidate\u0026#39;s relevant skills, experience, and specific qualifications for the role.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Actual compensation for this position may vary and will depend on multiple factors such as relevant qualifications, experience, education, and geographic location. For Full-Time Regular Employees, this position is also eligible for additional compensation as follows:\u0026lt;br\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Sales Roles: This position is eligible for a commission structure in addition to base salary.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Non-Sales Roles: This position is eligible for an annual bonus which is paid dependent on various factors, including and without limitation, individual and company performance in addition to base salary.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;Benefits\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;div style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p class=\u0026quot;x_MsoNormal\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;G-P values its employees and offers excellent benefits and perks including generous paid parental leave, flexible time off, spending accounts, medical insurance, dental insurance, vision insurance, sabbatical after 5 years and more.\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/div\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;div style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;/div\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;div style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p class=\u0026quot;x_MsoNormal\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;em\u0026gt;Individuals residing, or applying to work, in the\u0026lt;span class=\u0026quot;Apple-converted-space\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;United States: California or Philadelphia\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;,\u0026lt;span class=\u0026quot;Apple-converted-space\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;Pennsylvania,\u0026lt;span class=\u0026quot;Apple-converted-space\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;please review the following additional information:\u0026lt;br\u0026gt;\u0026lt;br\u0026gt;G-P will consider qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records in accordance with the California Fair Chance Act, Los Angeles City Fair Chance Act Ordinance, Los Angeles County Fair Chance Act Ordinance, and San Francisco Fair Chance Act Ordinance. Los Angeles applicants can review additional information regarding the Los Angeles City Fair Chance Act here:\u0026lt;span class=\u0026quot;Apple-converted-space\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;u\u0026gt;\u0026lt;a style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot; href=\u0026quot;https://shared.outlook.inky.com/link?domain=urldefense.com\u0026amp;amp;t=h.eJxFUF1PwjAU_Suy-GRkZV33hS8SVAQJjCw84EvTtR10dGvTFXQY_7sb0fhwT3LOufeem_vlnIx0xjfOwVrdjAHoKOMFrxvuUlWBsw8w_vVySlxJqLCtu1dnsNVSEdaAgoqDAitlBeV3cGRVBxOtpaCktk1HCmU6TI04E9t3PFfdZMtN7408F_ouRK5mBcYPi2wr-xoM1hHeZa-0Ykmp_UOJEXue0HYzgFmbTEUphzJJ8dwzDaIZEYty-rn5mIUaQS_2ZyZ98tIin33UwQt-W9rV3K-X1fEzupQVwXkeZrvJktX--vB-69zfOMf-A3upciLFhVih6qEmxtbdjUAqw4WU7eN-qK8vCXIKecgYz2mQ5JzFSQwDThiCNPaiIAZeFMEQ-Z3qIohGoY_6DN5nWGpOl79Nvcquyf9cdNz7_gFnYIED.MEQCICChUMF1POWhdDQaggM0FRjjJZ1lAcLJ15DZZDq3zupvAiAx1VO2lLsi1vKRs7_BzTCXX81huhJ5uOVsv4BIuvW39A\u0026quot; data-outlook-id=\u0026quot;1a1bee16-c2df-46f4-aa18-ca17f007e7b0\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Fair Chance Initiative for Hiring Ordinance\u0026lt;/a\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/u\u0026gt;, and Philadelphia applicants can review information pertaining to Philadelphia’s Fair Criminal Record Screening Standards Ordinance here:\u0026lt;span class=\u0026quot;Apple-converted-space\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;u\u0026gt;\u0026lt;a style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot; href=\u0026quot;https://shared.outlook.inky.com/link?domain=urldefense.com\u0026amp;amp;t=h.eJxFj1tvgjAAhf-Kkj0OSku5uZcZNi-bmxqefGpKW6FYoCko6rL_PjFb9vidk5wv58s6GmVNRlbRdbqdAHBDLvaiboXDmgqcPEDIb9f3vaMLqaiTNydQCS4pQC6CLkYeDNwIh2BGpbGTgtZM2AtpZJ3biva2btpOGEfzPSFP4_E6JLt0wSoel9orSoL565RdtmOUXuJElspW8YYsoWkxS6l8K5Pztp8HGiMYeXOzeYGbfTbva39G3lfd59KrV9XhHF7LipIsC9Ld9H3d8zL5eLAeR9ZheJerJqNKXmknm9rW1HS1MC1QjRFSqctzbuv7XT9jSASci4z5cSZ4FEfIF5RjxCIY-hGAYYgC7N1SByPsBh4eHGJwdMwcr39LQ8rv5n-WN4bfP1nrdLY.MEUCIA1-pP3eRDEfOnGzDHEJO_5cRL2WrthGwPNyFvUSTvbwAiEA_qA8gsy2BPUN-ydrjIruYGuY5d00Vye8J-RWpWPUJeo\u0026quot; data-outlook-id=\u0026quot;aed3a9bc-7948-41e2-8850-89268ac3f177\u0026quot;\u0026gt;Fair Chance Poster\u0026lt;/a\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/u\u0026gt;. Any consideration of a candidate’s background check with arrest or conviction records will include an individualized assessment based on the factors required by applicable law, including the candidate’s specific record and the duties and requirements of the specific job.\u0026lt;/em\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/div\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/div\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/div\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/div\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/div\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/div\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/div\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/div\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/div\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/div\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/div\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/div\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;G-P. Global Made Possible.\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;em\u0026gt;G-P is a proud Equal Opportunity Employer, and we are committed to building and maintaining a diverse, equitable and inclusive culture that celebrates authenticity. We prohibit discrimination and harassment against employees or applicants on the basis of race, color, creed, religion, national origin, ancestry, citizenship status, age, sex or gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, and pregnancy-related conditions), gender identity or expression (including transgender status), sexual orientation, marital status, military service and veteran status, physical or mental disability, genetic information, or any other legally protected status.\u0026lt;/em\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;em\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;G-P also is committed to providing reasonable accommodations to individuals with disabilities. Individuals with disabilities are encouraged to apply for these positions. If you need an accommodation due to a disability during the interview process, please contact us at \u0026lt;a style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\u0026quot; href=\u0026quot;mailto:careers@globalization-partners.com\u0026quot;\u0026gt;careers@g-p.com.\u0026lt;/a\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/em\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p style=\u0026quot;line-height: 1.5;\u0026quot;\u0026gt;\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/div\u0026gt;","departments":[{"id":4044006003,"name":"IT","child_ids":[],"parent_id":null}],"offices":[{"id":4026212003,"name":"United States","location":null,"child_ids":[4062251003,4075705003,4162347003,4068865003,4054684003,4101874003,4054952003,4054958003,4054960003,4054962003,4054965003,4094953003,4054949003,4001923003,4054946003,4054950003,4054955003,4054948003,4054953003,4054956003,4054943003,4054951003,4054957003,4054954003,4054944003,4054959003,4054961003,4054963003,4054945003,4054964003,4054947003,4054966003,4054967003,4054968003,4054969003,4054970003,4054971003,4054972003],"parent_id":null}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null,"compliance":null,"demographic_questions":{"header":"Demographic Questions","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"TextRun SCXW146471476 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW146471476 BCX8\"\u003eWe monitor the ethnicity and gender of our job applicants and employees to demonstrate our commitment to a policy of equal employment opportunity by recruiting, hiring, training, compensating, disciplining, and promoting employees without regard to race, color, age, religion, sex, national origin, disability, sexual orientation, gender expression, or any other basis protected by law. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"TextRun SCXW146471476 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW146471476 BCX8\"\u003eCompleting this survey is completely voluntary and refusal to provide it will not subject you to any adverse employment treatment.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"TextRun SCXW146471476 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW146471476 BCX8\"\u003e If you choose to complete this survey, your responses may be used in aggregate to identify areas of improvement in our hiring process or thereafter. The information obtained will be kept confidential.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","questions":[{"id":4000994003,"label":"I identify my gender as:","required":true,"type":"multi_value_single_select","answer_options":[{"id":4006125003,"label":"Male","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":4006126003,"label":"Female","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":4006128003,"label":"Non-binary","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":4006240003,"label":"I don't wish to answer","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":true}]},{"id":4017696003,"label":"I identify my ethnicity as (mark all that apply)","required":true,"type":"multi_value_single_select","answer_options":[{"id":4106546003,"label":"Alaskan Native / American Indian / Indigenous American / Native American  ","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":4106547003,"label":"Black/African/Caribbean/Black British  ","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":4106548003,"label":"White: Any other White ethnic background  ","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":4106549003,"label":"Hispanic or Latino (a person of Cuban, Mexican, Puerto Rican, South or Central American, or other Spanish culture or origin, regardless of race)","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":4106550003,"label":"White (English, Welsh, Scottish, Northern Irish or British)","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":4106551003,"label":"Asian British  ","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":4106552003,"label":"Central European   ","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":4106553003,"label":"Middle Eastern  ","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":4106554003,"label":"Eastern European  ","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":4106555003,"label":"East Asian (inclusive of Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Mongolian, Tibetan, and Taiwanese)  ","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":4106556003,"label":"South Asian (inclusive of Bangladeshi, Bhutanese, Indian, Nepali, Pakistani, and Sri Lankan)  ","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":4106557003,"label":"Southeast Asian (inclusive of Burmese, Cambodian, Filipino, Hmong, Indonesian, Laotian, Malaysian, Mien, Singaporean, Thai, and Vietnamese)  ","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":4106558003,"label":"Mixed/multiple ethnic groups  ","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":4106559003,"label":"I don't wish to answer","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":true}]}]},"questions":[{"description":null,"label":"First Name","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"first_name","type":"input_text","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Last Name","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"last_name","type":"input_text","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Preferred First Name","required":false,"fields":[{"name":"preferred_name","type":"input_text","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Email","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"email","type":"input_text","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Phone","required":false,"fields":[{"name":"phone","type":"input_text","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Resume/CV","required":false,"fields":[{"name":"resume","type":"input_file","values":[]},{"name":"resume_text","type":"textarea","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Cover Letter","required":false,"fields":[{"name":"cover_letter","type":"input_file","values":[]},{"name":"cover_letter_text","type":"textarea","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"LinkedIn Profile","required":false,"fields":[{"name":"question_31640703003","type":"input_text","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Website","required":false,"fields":[{"name":"question_31640704003","type":"input_text","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Are you currently eligible to work in the United States without visa sponsorship?","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"question_31640705003","type":"multi_value_single_select","values":[{"label":"Yes","value":1},{"label":"No","value":0}]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Do you now or in the future require visa sponsorship to continue working in the United States ?","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"question_31640706003","type":"multi_value_single_select","values":[{"label":"Yes","value":1},{"label":"No","value":0}]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Have you been referred by another G-P employee within the last 12 months?","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"question_31640707003","type":"multi_value_single_select","values":[{"label":"Yes","value":1},{"label":"No","value":0}]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Have you worked at G-P in the past?","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"question_31640708003","type":"multi_value_single_select","values":[{"label":"Yes","value":1},{"label":"No","value":0}]}]}],"location_questions":[{"description":null,"label":"Longitude","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"longitude","type":"input_hidden","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Latitude","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"latitude","type":"input_hidden","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Location","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"location","type":"input_text","values":[]}]}]}